<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<GameData>
  <LocalizedText>

    <!-- ==================== CIVILIZATION ==================== -->
    <Row Tag="LOC_CIVILIZATION_AOT_ELDIA_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Eldia</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_CIVILIZATION_AOT_ELDIA_NAME" Language="ru_RU">
      <Text>Эльдия</Text>
    </Row>

    <Row Tag="LOC_CIVILIZATION_AOT_ELDIA_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>The Eldian Empire, protected by three great walls, is a civilization built on faith and fortification.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_CIVILIZATION_AOT_ELDIA_DESCRIPTION" Language="ru_RU">
      <Text>Эльдийская империя, защищённая тремя великими стенами — цивилизация, построенная на вере и укреплениях.</Text>
    </Row>

    <Row Tag="LOC_CIVILIZATION_AOT_ELDIA_ADJECTIVE" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Eldian</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_CIVILIZATION_AOT_ELDIA_ADJECTIVE" Language="ru_RU">
      <Text>Эльдийский</Text>
    </Row>

    <!-- ==================== LEADER ==================== -->
    <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_AOT_EREN_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Eren Yeager</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_AOT_EREN_NAME" Language="ru_RU">
      <Text>Эрен Йегер</Text>
    </Row>

    <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_AOT_EREN_QUOTE" Language="en_US">
      <Text>If you win, you live. If you lose, you die. If you don't fight, you can't win.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_AOT_EREN_QUOTE" Language="ru_RU">
      <Text>Если победишь — выживешь. Если проиграешь — умрёшь. Если не будешь сражаться — не сможешь победить.</Text>
    </Row>

    <!-- ==================== CIV ABILITY ==================== -->
    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_AOT_THREE_WALLS_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>The Three Walls</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_AOT_THREE_WALLS_NAME" Language="ru_RU">
      <Text>Три Стены</Text>
    </Row>

    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_AOT_THREE_WALLS_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>+100% [ICON_Production] Production toward wall buildings. Cities with walls receive +4 [ICON_Faith] Faith from the Wall Cult.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_AOT_THREE_WALLS_DESCRIPTION" Language="ru_RU">
      <Text>+100% [ICON_Production] производства стен. Города со стенами получают +4 [ICON_Faith] веры от Культа Стен.</Text>
    </Row>

    <!-- ==================== LEADER ABILITY ==================== -->
    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_AOT_FOUNDERS_WILL_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Founder's Will</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_AOT_FOUNDERS_WILL_NAME" Language="ru_RU">
      <Text>Воля Прародителя</Text>
    </Row>

    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_AOT_FOUNDERS_WILL_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Land combat units receive +7 [ICON_Strength] Combat Strength on your territory. +50% [ICON_Production] Production toward the Encampment district and its buildings. Scout units gain +1 [ICON_Movement] Movement and ignore movement penalties in Forests and Rainforests.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_AOT_FOUNDERS_WILL_DESCRIPTION" Language="ru_RU">
      <Text>Наземные боевые юниты получают +7 [ICON_Strength] силы на своей территории. +50% [ICON_Production] производства Военного лагеря и его зданий. Разведчики получают +1 [ICON_Movement] передвижения и игнорируют штрафы передвижения в лесах и тропических лесах.</Text>
    </Row>

    <!-- ==================== UNIQUE UNIT ==================== -->
    <Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_AOT_SCOUT_REGIMENT_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Scout Regiment</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_AOT_SCOUT_REGIMENT_NAME" Language="ru_RU">
      <Text>Разведкорпус</Text>
    </Row>

    <Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_AOT_SCOUT_REGIMENT_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Eldian unique melee unit that replaces the Swordsman. Higher [ICON_Strength] Combat Strength and [ICON_Movement] Movement. Does not require [ICON_RESOURCE_IRON] Iron. Ignores movement penalties in Forests and Rainforests thanks to ODM Gear.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_AOT_SCOUT_REGIMENT_DESCRIPTION" Language="ru_RU">
      <Text>Уникальный юнит ближнего боя Эльдии, заменяющий Мечника. Повышенные [ICON_Strength] сила и [ICON_Movement] передвижение. Не требует [ICON_RESOURCE_IRON] железа. Игнорирует штрафы передвижения в лесах и тропических лесах благодаря УПМБ.</Text>
    </Row>

    <!-- ==================== UNIQUE BUILDING ==================== -->
    <Row Tag="LOC_BUILDING_AOT_WALL_MARIA_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Wall Maria</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_BUILDING_AOT_WALL_MARIA_NAME" Language="ru_RU">
      <Text>Стена Мария</Text>
    </Row>

    <Row Tag="LOC_BUILDING_AOT_WALL_MARIA_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Eldian unique wall that replaces Ancient Walls. Provides +2 [ICON_Housing] Housing and +2 [ICON_Production] Production. 50% more durable than standard walls.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_BUILDING_AOT_WALL_MARIA_DESCRIPTION" Language="ru_RU">
      <Text>Уникальная стена Эльдии, заменяющая Древние стены. Даёт +2 [ICON_Housing] жильё и +2 [ICON_Production] производство. На 50% прочнее обычных стен.</Text>
    </Row>

