    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_AOT_FOUNDERS_DEFENSE_DESCRIPTION" Language="ru_RU">
      <Text>+7 [ICON_Strength] силы на своей территории.</Text>
    </Row>

    <Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_AOT_FOUNDERS_DEFENSE_PREVIEW" Language="en_US">
      <Text>+7 Founder's Will (own territory)</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_AOT_FOUNDERS_DEFENSE_PREVIEW" Language="ru_RU">
