    <Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_AOT_ODM_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>ODM Gear</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_AOT_ODM_NAME" Language="ru_RU">
      <Text>УПМБ</Text>
    </Row>

    <Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_AOT_ODM_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Ignores movement penalties in Forests and Rainforests.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_AOT_ODM_DESCRIPTION" Language="ru_RU">
      <Text>Игнорирует штрафы передвижения в лесах и тропических лесах.</Text>
    </Row>

    <Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_AOT_ODM_SCOUTS_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>ODM Equipment</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_AOT_ODM_SCOUTS_NAME" Language="ru_RU">
      <Text>Экипировка УПМБ</Text>
    </Row>

    <Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_AOT_ODM_SCOUTS_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>+1 [ICON_Movement] Movement. Ignores movement penalties in Forests and Rainforests.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_AOT_ODM_SCOUTS_DESCRIPTION" Language="ru_RU">
      <Text>+1 [ICON_Movement] передвижение. Игнорирует штрафы передвижения в лесах и тропических лесах.</Text>
    </Row>

    <!-- ==================== AGENDA ==================== -->
    <Row Tag="LOC_AGENDA_AOT_WALL_DEFENDER_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Defender of the Walls</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_AGENDA_AOT_WALL_DEFENDER_NAME" Language="ru_RU">
      <Text>Защитник Стен</Text>
    </Row>

    <Row Tag="LOC_AGENDA_AOT_WALL_DEFENDER_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Respects civilizations that build strong defenses. Distrusts those who declare surprise wars.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_AGENDA_AOT_WALL_DEFENDER_DESCRIPTION" Language="ru_RU">
      <Text>Уважает цивилизации с крепкой обороной. Не доверяет тем, кто объявляет внезапные войны.</Text>
    </Row>

